{
  "id": "vci.oidf.private-key-jwt.001",
  "description": "The private_key_jwt client authentication on the token endpoint (RFC 7523): when the AS metadata declares the method, the engine builds the client assertion JWT and the host signs it — the assertion's type and value ride the form, the signing key named by the conventional client-auth id.",
  "provenance": "oidf",
  "generator": {
    "repo": "sirosfoundation/siros-wallet-core",
    "commit": "09ab930b4d8f0565ec75bdcd102f28c427ba1ea1",
    "date": "2026-11-04"
  },
  "spec_refs": [
    "RFC 7523 section 2.2 (the client_assertion_type and client_assertion parameters)",
    "RFC 7523 section 3 (the assertion is single-use: one fresh jti per request)",
    "OpenID4VCI 1.0 section 5.1 (the AS metadata's token_endpoint_auth_methods_supported names the method)"
  ],
  "setup": {
    "time": 1700000000,
    "entropy_seed": 42,
    "pdp": {
      "trusted": true,
      "decision": "in the registry"
    }
  },
  "script": [
    {
      "wmp_in": {
        "method": "wmp.flow.start",
        "params": {
          "flow_id": "flow-oidf-client-auth-001",
          "flow_type": "oid4vci",
          "params": {
            "credential_issuer": "https://issuer.example",
            "credential_configuration_ids": [
              "UniversityDegree"
            ],
            "client_id": "wallet-oidf-001",
            "grants": {
              "urn:ietf:params:oauth:grant-type:pre-authorized_code": {
                "pre-authorized_code": "preauth-code-oidf-client-auth-001"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "http_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "GET",
          "url": "https://issuer.example/.well-known/openid-credential-issuer",
          "purpose": "IssuerMetadata"
        },
        "reply": {
          "status": 200,
          "content_type": "application/json",
          "body": {
            "credential_issuer": "https://issuer.example",
            "authorization_servers": [
              "https://as.example"
            ],
            "credential_configurations_supported": {
              "UniversityDegree": {
                "scope": "openid"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "http_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "GET",
          "url": "https://as.example/.well-known/oauth-authorization-server",
          "purpose": "AsMetadata"
        },
        "reply": {
          "status": 200,
          "body": {
            "issuer": "https://as.example",
            "token_endpoint": "https://as.example/token",
            "token_endpoint_auth_methods_supported": [
              "private_key_jwt"
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "host_ask": {
        "expect": {
          "kind": "sign",
          "inputs": {
            "key_id": "client-auth"
          }
        },
        "answer": {
          "value": {
            "signature": [
              9,
              8,
              7,
              6
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "http_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "POST",
          "url": "https://as.example/token",
          "purpose": "Token",
          "form": {
            "grant_type": "urn:ietf:params:oauth:grant-type:pre-authorized_code",
            "pre-authorized_code": "preauth-code-oidf-client-auth-001",
            "client_assertion_type": "urn:ietf:params:oauth:client-assertion-type:jwt-bearer",
            "client_assertion": "*"
          }
        },
        "reply": {
          "status": 200,
          "body": {
            "access_token": "at-oidf-client-auth-001",
            "token_type": "Bearer",
            "c_nonce": "nonce-oidf-client-auth-001"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "host_ask": {
        "expect": {
          "kind": "signing_key"
        },
        "answer": {
          "value": {
            "jwk": {
              "kty": "EC",
              "crv": "P-256",
              "x": "ktT77AqMntawPyU772lBg8nd7cwENrYyOL_KWbYN8Jc",
              "y": "67lPXEq5gJdimDYD0AacxLfRfIm2-fSNd3HBqyXXvBI"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "host_ask": {
        "expect": {
          "kind": "sign"
        },
        "answer": {
          "value": {
            "signature": [
              1,
              2,
              3,
              4
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "http_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "POST",
          "url": "https://issuer.example/credential",
          "purpose": "Credential",
          "json": {
            "credential_configuration_id": "UniversityDegree",
            "proofs": {
              "jwt": [
                "*"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "reply": {
          "status": 200,
          "body": {
            "credential": "credential-jwt-oidf-client-auth-001",
            "notification_id": "notif-oidf-client-auth-001"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "http_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "POST",
          "url": "https://issuer.example/notification",
          "purpose": "Notification",
          "json": {
            "notification_id": "notif-oidf-client-auth-001",
            "event": "credential_accepted"
          }
        },
        "reply": {
          "status": 200,
          "body": {}
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wmp_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
          "params": {
            "flow_id": "flow-oidf-client-auth-001",
            "step": "offer_parsed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wmp_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
          "params": {
            "flow_id": "flow-oidf-client-auth-001",
            "step": "metadata_resolved"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wmp_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
          "params": {
            "flow_id": "flow-oidf-client-auth-001",
            "step": "as_discovered"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wmp_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
          "params": {
            "flow_id": "flow-oidf-client-auth-001",
            "step": "trust_evaluated"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wmp_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
          "params": {
            "flow_id": "flow-oidf-client-auth-001",
            "step": "token_received"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wmp_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
          "params": {
            "flow_id": "flow-oidf-client-auth-001",
            "step": "credential_received"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wmp_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "wmp.flow.complete",
          "params": {
            "flow_id": "flow-oidf-client-auth-001",
            "result": {
              "credential": "credential-jwt-oidf-client-auth-001"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Backed by the OIDF conformance suite result: plan oid4vci-1_0-wallet-test-plan, suite 5.3.4, client_auth_type=private_key_jwt, module oid4vci-1_0-wallet-test-credential-issuance PASSED on 2026-11-04 (plan detail: https://localhost.emobix.co.uk:8443/plan-detail.html?log=465soSg8t5Gft). The suite's plan registered the client key under a kid; this vector exercises the no-kid path where the sign ask names the conventional client-auth key id — the suite-validated registered-kid path is the same code with the flow's client_key_kid threaded."
}
